  "body": "NB: Title conversion to freehold is currently in progress, with completion expected in the near future offering added value and ownership flexibility.\r\n\r\nUnrivalled Luxury with Panoramic Views\r\n\r\nNestled in the highly sought-after Castor Bay, this well-maintained 10-year-old home was built by Master Builder and offered for the first time since its completion. It is a truly rare opportunity.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, you will be captivated by the breath-taking views that frame Auckland’s iconic landmarks. Witness the sunrise erupt over Rangitoto Island at dawn, watch cruise ships, freighters and sailboats glide across the sparkling sea, listen to the gentle rhythm of waves on Milford Beach, and gaze out over the tranquil waters of Lake Pupuke. As evening falls, the sky is set ablaze with magnificent sunsets, and after dark, the glittering lights of the Sky Tower and the city skyline create an enchanting urban panorama. All of this can be enjoyed from the comfort of your home. Watch the America’s Cup races from your own balcony, and marvel at the Sky Tower’s spectacular fireworks displays without ever leaving your living room.\r\n\r\nA Home Designed for Modern Family Living:\r\nWith a generous 352m2 floor plan, this residence is an entertainer’s dream and a private sanctuary for\r\nthe family. Every detail has been thoughtfully considered to ensure privacy and comfort.\r\n\r\n• Five Ensuite Bedrooms: Each bedroom features its own private bathroom, offering a hotel-like experience for family and guests. The oversized bedroom on the ground level can also serve as a home office, gym or media room.\r\n\r\n• Luxurious Wardrobe Space: Two of the spacious bedrooms include walk-in wardrobes, providing ample storage with elegant convenience.\r\n\r\n• Guest Convenience: A separate guest powder room adds to the home’s functionality.\r\n\r\n• A super-sized double garage plus abundant parking in the yard.\r\n\r\n• Low-maintenance gardens allow you to enjoy the outdoors without the burden of extensive upkeep, giving you more time to focus on the lifestyle you love.\r\n\r\nAn Unbeatable Location & School Zones:\r\nThis property is more than just a home—it is an investment in your family’s future. Zoned for top-tier schools, including Campbells Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Westlake Boys’ High School and Westlake Girls’ High School.\r\n\r\nPerfectly Positioned:\r\nEverything the North Shore has to offer is at your doorstep. You are moments away from the beautiful sands of Milford and Castor Bay beaches, Milford’s boutique shops and cafés, Pupuke Golf Course and local sports fields. North Shore Hospital and Smales Farm busway are also close by, ensuring your needs for healthcare and transport are well catered for.\r\n\r\nViews, education, entertainment, shopping, transport—this property truly has it all. Don’t miss this\r\nexceptional opportunity.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
